# Fog on walls and trails (WALL_TRAIL_FOG in main.c): far walls and the far end of a trail
# dim with distance, like the floor they stand on; near ones stay at full brightness.
wait 17
# The game starts in 1st person; these steps were written from iso, so switch to it first
press down
wait 0.3
shot fog_iso
# Lay a long trail at full speed, then look back along it in 1st person
press c 6
wait 5
shot fog_iso_trail
press down
wait 1
shot fog_wall
press left
wait 0.4
press left
wait 1.5
shot fog_trail
